-- LRRXWARE // ACTION WORLDS V15.1 // PROMPT ANCHOR
-- Eight authored action casts, a visual world portal, ten lettering profiles,
-- and complete hyphen/apostrophe solve lanes without turn-time rescans.
-- Compatibility bootstrap: REAL/Xeno-safe UI, HTTP, filesystem, and service fallbacks.
-- Word engine and controls retained; completed words return through the session reset.
-- The guardian portrait is embedded in this one-file build. No companion PNG
-- is required when the executor exposes writefile + a custom-asset function.

